  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *alegrado*",
    "*alegrar a alguien* = to make someone happy (*Me alegra verte* — It makes me happy to see you)",
    "*alegrarse (de)* = reflexive form, to be glad/pleased about (*Me alegro de que hayas venido* — I'm glad you came)",
    "*¡Me alegro!* = I'm glad! — very common expression",
    "*alegre* (adjective) = happy, cheerful; *la alegría* = joy, happiness"
  ],
